  "ingredients": [
    "2 eggs",
    "2 tablespoons canola oil",
    "salt to taste",
    "1 pound chicken livers, rinsed and trimmed",
    "2 onions, chopped",
    "1 pinch white sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qD7Z_4AJssE_JhRb5D4M2w1PyMU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/76193-simple-chopped-liver-VAT-005-step-01-11288ce104154894b4b40fea3b1472a5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/76193/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place eggs into a saucepan and cover with water. Bring to a boil, then remove the from heat and let eggs stand in hot water for 15 minutes. Remove eggs from hot water, cool under cold running water, and peel.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WuMy-f_8UEdQU0cg5awXwPlHUWM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/76193-simple-chopped-liver-VAT-006-step-02-a0c0b38482304b20b5db831f34d24bfa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/76193/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, heat canola oil in a skillet over medium heat. Add onions and cook, stirring occasionally, until soft and translucent, about 5 minutes. Reduce heat to medium-low and continue cooking and stirring until onions are very tender and golden brown, 5 to 10 more minutes. Transfer to a plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xGgwKRngFn-NQ2_-1qNo_fHFv5c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/76193-simple-chopped-liver-VAT-007-step-03-916698aceeb14056bbf9c1914c75206b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/76193/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook chicken livers in the same skillet until no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear, 5 to 10 minutes. Place chicken livers onto the same plate as onions and allow to cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/38ecp9XFE8jKH1pxB91qwt8ZFbE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/76193-simple-chopped-liver-VAT-008-step-04-aa07dc2d09b14f8c8d104b3e9e8a5c8c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/76193/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Process chicken livers and onions in a food processor to the desired consistency.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qjHQnc1Vnuk9qzZ0SA6P53qm9tI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/76193-simple-chopped-liver-VAT-009-step-05-f32a3911aff2485e99c319a4653a1052.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/76193/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to a bowl, season with salt and sugar, and stir in chopped eggs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lIK7MT5jIIPASpbmkKgsdlo0WB8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/76193-simple-chopped-liver-VAT-010-step-06-4245bbb6ae514c9fa97fa355750479ad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/76193/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chill before serving, about 2 hours. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/h7jFN--BJwCe9tNp1qATb3tTenU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/76193-simple-chopped-liver-VAT-011-step-07-c46336b1e2564a3e91e6669602377697.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/76193/step_07.webp"
    }
